  "correctValue": "0",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mn>20</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>20</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is skew-symmetric</p><p>Hence, the sum of principal diagonal elements&nbsp;of <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
